@baseUrl = http://localhost:8008
@threadId = test-session-1
@studentId = 123

### 1. Iniciar sessão de anamnese (nova thread)
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "thread_id": "{{threadId}}",
  "message": "Olá, gostaria de praticar anamnese.",
  "student_id": "{{studentId}}"
}

### 2. Pergunta relevante — dor torácica
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "thread_id": "{{threadId}}",
  "message": "Bom dia, onde sente a dor exactamente?"
}

### 3. Pergunta relevante — início dos sintomas
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "thread_id": "{{threadId}}",
  "message": "Quando começaram os sintomas?"
}

### 4. Pergunta irrelevante 1/3
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "thread_id": "{{threadId}}",
  "message": "Qual é o teu filme favorito?"
}

### 5. Pergunta irrelevante 2/3
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "thread_id": "{{threadId}}",
  "message": "Gostas de futebol?"
}

### 6. Pergunta irrelevante 3/3 — deve acionar o tutor
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "thread_id": "{{threadId}}",
  "message": "Que tempo está lá fora?"
}

### 7. Pergunta relevante após tutor — retoma o fluxo normal
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "thread_id": "{{threadId}}",
  "message": "Sente alguma dificuldade em respirar?"
}

### 8. Terminar entrevista — deve acionar a avaliação
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "thread_id": "{{threadId}}",
  "message": "Terminei a minha entrevista."
}

###########################################################
# RAIO-X — fluxo completo de análise radiológica
###########################################################

@xrayThreadId = xray-session-1
@xrayImageUrl = https://huggingface.co/spaces/google/rad-learn-companion-samples/resolve/main/images/1.png

### 9. Iniciar sessão de raio-X (nova thread)
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "thread_id": "{{xrayThreadId}}",
  "message": "Quero praticar radiologia. Aqui está a imagem: {{xrayImageUrl}}",
  "student_id": "{{studentId}}"
}

### 10. Achado correto — deve confirmar e encorajar
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "thread_id": "{{xrayThreadId}}",
  "message": "Consigo identificar uma Fissura interlobar formal."
}

### 11. Achado correto — segundo achado
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "thread_id": "{{xrayThreadId}}",
  "message": "Também noto uma Hemiaxila direita."
}

### 14. Achado incorreto 3/3 — deve acionar o tutor
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "thread_id": "{{xrayThreadId}}",
  "message": "Observo um alargamento do mediastino."
}

### 15. Achado correto após tutor — retoma fluxo normal
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "thread_id": "{{xrayThreadId}}",
  "message": "Observo um alargamento do mediastino."
}

### 16. Terminar análise — deve acionar a avaliação
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "thread_id": "{{xrayThreadId}}",
  "message": "Terminei a minha análise."
}
